  "title": "Tatsu®",
  "description": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Strong and Supple, Premium, 100% Fluorocarbon Performance Fishing Line, Virtually Invisible</strong></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Seaguar Tatsu is the world's only double-structure fluorocarbon mainline delivering amazingly strong, yet supple performance. </span></p>\n<p><span>Our exclusive double-structure process fuses two 100% fluorocarbon resins into one solid line that offers the best combination of strength &amp; castability. </span></p>\n<p><span>Soft, supple and smooth casting with exceptional sensitivity, low memory, virtually no stretch, fast sinking and superior knot strength for unmatched performance-in most any conditions. </span></p>\n<p><span>Ideal for freshwater multi-species fishing applications - fish can't see it and it's very soft and sensitive. Easy to manage on a reel.</span><br></p>\n<p>________________________</p>\n<p>Tatsu 200yd spools</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/6548/5531/files/Prop65-warning_v1_550.png?v=1780670842\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Tatsu 1000yd spools</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/6548/5531/files/Prop65-warning_v3_550.png?v=1780670841\" alt=\"\"></p>",
